*.zip
**/out/
**/.ffbin/
**/.video_segs*
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
# local-only folders
Claude outputs/
logs/
# third-party upstream clones: recreated by `sh pipeline/get-tools.sh` (list + pinned commits in tools/README.md)
tools/*
!tools/README.md
# GrowKaz Stickman kit: committed on purpose (Vivek 2026-11-11) so JP's Mac gets it. Third-party, no licence file: keep the repo PRIVATE.
!tools/growkaz-stickman/
!tools/chatterbox/
tools/chatterbox/.venv/
# generated: `sh pipeline/sync-skills.sh` rebuilds it from tools/ + skills/
.claude/skills/
# real-sfx comes from Clipwing (no licence file: private use only, don't redistribute) -> copied in by get-tools.sh
skills/real-sfx/
# secrets
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
# private: Vivek's Whispers characters (based on real people) - NOT in the public repo; share privately (see channels/whispers/characters/README.md)
channels/whispers/characters/vivek-cast/
channels/whispers/confessions/*/assets/
# per-machine build markers
CLOUD-BUILDING

# transfer scratch + third-party plugin unzips (no licence: never commit)
_xfer/
lab/*/plugin/
!lab/2026-11-09-growkaz-plugin-test/plugin/
lab/2026-11-09-growkaz-plugin-test/plugin/**/node_modules/
# downloaded reference clips + extracted frames: study only, other creators footage, heavy -> never commit (re-fetch: sh pipeline/fetch-refs.sh)
references/videos/*/
